---
const siteUrl = "https://paligakrzychu.github.io/ai-alm-oss-landing";
const linkedIn = "https://www.linkedin.com/in/christopher-paliga-986352a7/";
const email = "picospitfire@icloud.com";
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>ai-alm-oss — Governed AI-First ALM | Issue to Traceable PR</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Research prototype of a governed AI-First ALM orchestrator. Deterministic Jira state machine (STAGE/ROLE/AGENT) → autonomous issue-to-PR pipeline with human-in-the-loop. Private prototype, available on request." />
		<meta name="author" content="Krzysztof Paliga" />
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<meta property="og:url" content={siteUrl} />
		<meta property="og:title" content="ai-alm-oss — Governed AI-First ALM" />
		<meta property="og:description" content="From GitHub Issue to Traceable PR. Deterministic Jira state machine, exclusive mutator, zero BLOCKED states. Research prototype — private repo, demo on request." />
		<meta property="og:image" content={`${siteUrl}/og-image.png`} />
		<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
		<meta name="twitter:title" content="ai-alm-oss — Governed AI-First ALM" />
		<meta name="twitter:description" content="Governed autonomy for ALM: Jira STAGE/ROLE/AGENT → deterministic pipeline → auditable PR." />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}/favicon.svg`} />
		<style>
			@import "tailwindcss";
		</style>
	</head>
	<body class="bg-[#fafaf9] text-zinc-900 antialiased selection:bg-zinc-900 selection:text-white">
		<!-- Header -->
		<header class="sticky top-0 z-50 backdrop-blur bg-white/80 border-b border-zinc-200">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 h-14 flex items-center justify-between">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2.5">
					<div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-md bg-zinc-900 flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[11px] font-bold tracking-widest">AAO</div>
					<span class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-tight">ai-alm-oss</span>
					<span class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 ml-2 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 text-[11px] font-medium text-amber-800">● Private Prototype</span>
				</div>
				<nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 text-sm text-zinc-600">
					<a href="#pipeline" class="hover:text-zinc-900 transition">Pipeline</a>
					<a href="#governance" class="hover:text-zinc-900 transition">Governance</a>
					<a href="#demo" class="hover:text-zinc-900 transition">Demo</a>
					<a href="#stack" class="hover:text-zinc-900 transition">Stack</a>
				</nav>
				<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
					<a href={linkedIn} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="hidden sm:inline-flex text-sm px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:bg-zinc-50 transition">LinkedIn</a>
					<a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=ai-alm-oss%20—%20private%20demo%20request`} class="text-sm px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 text-white hover:bg-zinc-800 transition font-medium">Request Demo</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</header>

		<!-- Hero -->
		<section class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 pt-14 pb-10 md:pt-20 md:pb-16">
			<div class="max-w-3xl">
				<div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-xs text-zinc-600 mb-5">
					<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500 animate-pulse"></span>
					Research Prototype • OSS Tooling • Jira Cloud + GitHub
					<span class="hidden sm:inline text-zinc-400">— built for AI-First ALM</span>
				</div>
				<h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-semibold tracking-tight leading-[1.05]">
					Governed AI-First ALM.<br />
					<span class="text-zinc-500">From GitHub Issue to traceable PR</span>
					<span class="text-zinc-900"> — with human in the loop.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-5 text-[17px] leading-7 text-zinc-600 max-w-2xl">
					<span class="font-medium text-zinc-900">ai-alm-oss</span> is a deterministic orchestrator for autonomous ALM.
					Jira is the source of truth — a 3-dimensional state machine
					<code class="px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-900 text-white text-xs font-mono">STAGE / ROLE / AGENT</code>
					governs every transition from discovery to verified pull request. No <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-200 text-xs font-mono">BLOCKED</code> states. No guesswork.
				</p>
				<div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
					<a href={`mailto:${email}?subject=ai-alm-oss%20—%20private%20demo%20request&body=Hi%20Krzysztof%2C%0A%0AI%20saw%20ai-alm-oss%20and%20would%20like%20a%20private%20walkthrough.%0A`} class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-zinc-800 transition">
						Request Private Demo
						<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 3l5 5-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
					</a>
					<a href={linkedIn} target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-zinc-50 transition">
						<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/></svg>
						Connect on LinkedIn
					</a>
					<a href="#demo" class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium text-zinc-600 hover:text-zinc-900 transition">See demo ↓</a>
				</div>
				<p class="mt-4 text-xs text-zinc-500">Private research prototype — code available on request for hiring managers (NDA-friendly). No tracking. No cookies.</p>
			</div>

			<!-- Pipeline preview card -->
			<div class="mt-10 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white overflow-hidden shadow-sm">
				<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 px-4 py-3 border-b border-zinc-100 bg-zinc-50/50">
					<span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-400"></span><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400"></span><span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-400"></span>
					<span class="ml-3 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">ai-alm-oss — canonical loop</span>
					<span class="ml-auto hidden sm:inline text-xs text-zinc-400">AGENTS.md — single source of truth</span>
				</div>
				<div class="p-6 md:p-8">
					<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono">
						<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-zinc-900 text-white">onboard</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-300">→</span>
						<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-zinc-200">discover</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-300">→</span>
						<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-zinc-200">po</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-300">→</span>
						<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-zinc-200">qa</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-300">→</span>
						<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-zinc-200">arch</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-300">→</span>
						<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-zinc-200">sec</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-300">→</span>
						<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200 text-indigo-700">impl</span>
						<span class="text-zinc-300">→</span>
						<span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200 text-emerald-700">ship</span>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-4 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 text-xs">
						<div class="rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 p-3">
							<div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 font-mono">impl</div>
							<div class="text-zinc-600 mt-1 font-mono">dev-analyst → dev-update-approved → dev-impl → qa-impl</div>
							<div class="text-zinc-400 mt-1">Sequential. No parallel dev∥qa. No cross-read.</div>
						</div>
						<div class="rounded-xl bg-zinc-50 border border-zinc-200 p-3">
							<div class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 font-mono">ship</div>
							<div class="text-zinc-600 mt-1 font-mono">verify → pr → feedback</div>
							<div class="text-zinc-400 mt-1">verify = READY_FOR_PR gate. pr = explicit human approval.</div>
						</div>
						<div class="rounded-xl bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 p-3">
							<div class="font-semibold text-amber-900 font-mono">entry → exit</div>
							<div class="text-amber-800 mt-1 font-mono">public repo (owner/repo) → traceable PR</div>
							<div class="text-amber-700/70 mt-1">Full lineage: Jira + GitHub, never AAO.</div>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Problem / Solution -->
		<section class="bg-white border-y border-zinc-200">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
				<div class="max-w-2xl">
					<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Why governed autonomy beats raw automation</h2>
					<p class="mt-2 text-zinc-600">Particularly in regulated, B2B contexts like Transportation Management — auditability matters more than speed.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="mt-8 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-6">
						<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-zinc-100 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">⧗</div>
						<h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold">Manual ALM is slow</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-600">Handovers between PO → DEV → QA → SEC → ARCH lose context. Status in Jira drifts from reality. Traceability is an afterthought.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-6">
						<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-red-50 border border-red-200 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">⚠</div>
						<h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold">AI without governance = chaos</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-600">Unbounded agents overwrite each other, invent statuses like <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100 text-xs font-mono">BLOCKED</code>, and produce unreviewable PRs.</p>
					</div>
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-900 bg-zinc-900 text-white p-6">
						<div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-white/10 flex items-center justify-center text-sm">◆</div>
						<h3 class="mt-4 font-semibold">ai-alm-oss = governed autonomy</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-300">Every action is a legal <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/10 text-xs font-mono">STAGE</code> transition. One exclusive mutator at a time. Human approvals are explicit (<code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-white/10 text-xs font-mono">✅ / APPROVE:&lt;id&gt;</code>).</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Pipeline detail -->
		<section id="pipeline" class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
			<div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Canonical loop — one ticket, one column move at a time</h2>
				<span class="text-xs font-mono px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-white border border-zinc-200 text-zinc-600">Variant I — exclusive mutator</span>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 max-w-3xl">Orchestrator knows the full state machine but never duplicates skill work. One step = one legal <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100 text-xs font-mono">STAGE</code> transition. The chosen skill then mutates content. If a move is illegal — orchestrator leaves a comment, not a silent failure.</p>

			<div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white overflow-hidden">
				<div class="overflow-x-auto">
					<table class="w-full text-sm">
						<thead class="bg-zinc-50 border-b border-zinc-200 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-500">
							<tr><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-medium">Stage</th><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-medium">Trigger</th><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-medium">Next AGENT (convention)</th><th class="text-left px-4 py-3 font-medium">Human gate</th></tr>
						</thead>
						<tbody class="divide-y divide-zinc-100 font-mono text-xs">
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">discover candidate approved</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">✅</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-po-analyze</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">PO</td></tr>
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">AC approved</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">APPROVE</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-po-prep-decompose</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">PO</td></tr>
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">decompose done</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">—</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-qa-analyze</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">—</td></tr>
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">GENERATED QA approved</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">✅</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-arch-analyze</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">QA</td></tr>
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">ARCH approved</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">✅</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-sec-analyze</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">ARCH</td></tr>
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">SEC approved</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">✅</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-dev-analyst</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">SEC</td></tr>
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">contract approved</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">✅</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-dev-impl</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">DEV</td></tr>
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">dev-impl done</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">—</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-qa-impl</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">—</td></tr>
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">qa-impl done</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">—</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-verify</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">—</td></tr>
							<tr><td class="px-4 py-2.5">verify ready</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">human gate</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5">aialm-oss-pr</td><td class="px-4 py-2.5 text-zinc-500">PO/lead</td></tr>
						</tbody>
					</table>
				</div>
				<div class="px-4 py-3 bg-amber-50 border-t border-amber-100 text-xs text-amber-800">Pickup convention: human hands off by setting <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100 font-mono">ROLE=AI</code> (transient) at <code class="font-mono">READY / AWAITING_HUMAN_APPROVAL</code> + <code class="font-mono">AGENT=none</code>. Orchestrator then sets <code class="font-mono">AWAITING_AGENT_PICKUP</code> + concrete <code class="font-mono">AGENT</code>. Idempotent — re-run → <code class="font-mono">SKIPPED</code>.</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<!-- Governance -->
		<section id="governance" class="bg-white border-y border-zinc-200">
			<div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-16">
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Governance is the product</h2>
				<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-600 max-w-3xl">Status is a tuple of three independent dimensions. Custom fields <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100 text-xs font-mono">AIALM STAGE / ROLE / AGENT</code> (select) are the source of truth. Native Jira column is atomically synced via <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100 text-xs font-mono">STAGE_NATIVE_STATUS</code>.</p>

				<div class="mt-8 grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
					<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 overflow-hidden">
						<div class="px-5 py-3 bg-zinc-900 text-white text-sm font-medium">State tuple — 3 dimensions</div>
						<div class="p-5 space-y-4 text-sm">
							<div>
								<div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-zinc-500 tracking-widest">STAGE</div>
								<div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs">
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-200">IDLE</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200">AWAITING_HUMAN_APPROVAL</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200">AWAITING_AGENT_PICKUP</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200">IN_PROGRESS_BY_AGENT</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-emerald-50 border border-emerald-200">READY</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-900 text-white">DONE</span>
								</div>
							</div>
							<div>
								<div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-zinc-500 tracking-widest">ROLE (scalar — one owner at a time)</div>
								<div class="mt-1 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 font-mono text-xs">
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-zinc-200">PO</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-zinc-200">DEV</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-zinc-200">QA</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-zinc-200">SEC</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-zinc-200">ARCH</span>
									<span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-violet-50 border border-violet-200">AI (transient)</span>
								</div>
								<p class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-500">Sequence PO→DEV→QA→SEC→ARCH. Parallel work = separate child tickets.</p>
							</div>
							<div>
								<div class="text-xs font-mono font-semibold text-zinc-500 tracking-widest">AGENT</div>
								<div class="mt-1 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-700"><span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-white border border-zinc-200">none</span> <span class="text-zinc-400">+ 18 skills</span> <code class="ml-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-zinc-100">aialm-oss-*</code></div>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="space-y-4">
						<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-amber-50 p-5">
							<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold text-amber-900">Invariants (deterministic)</h3>
							<ul class="mt-2 space-y-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-amber-900/80 leading-5">
								<li>• <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100">AGENT=none ⇔ STAGE ∈ &#123;IDLE, AWAITING_HUMAN_APPROVAL, DONE, READY&#125;</code></li>
								<li>• <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100">AGENT≠none ⇔ STAGE ∈ &#123;AWAITING_AGENT_PICKUP, IN_PROGRESS_BY_AGENT&#125;</code></li>
								<li>• <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100">ROLE=AI</code> only at <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100">AGENT=none</code> (transient handoff)</li>
								<li>• <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100">DONE → AGENT=none, ROLE=null</code> (no active owner)</li>
								<li>• No <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100">BLOCKED</code> — missing requisite = stay in <code class="px-1 py-0.5 rounded bg-amber-100">IDLE/AWAITING_AGENT_PICKUP</code> + comment</li>
							</ul>
						</div>
						<div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 p-5 bg-white">
							<h3 class="text-sm font-semibold">Legal transitions only</h3>
							<div class="mt-2 grid grid-cols-1 gap-1.5 text-xs font-mono text-zinc-600">
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-zinc-100">IDLE</span> <span class="text-zinc-400">→</span> <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200">AWAITING_AGENT_PICKUP</span> <span class="text-zinc-400 ml-auto">agent start</span></div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200">AWAITING_AGENT_PICKUP</span> <span class="text-zinc-400">→</span> <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200">IN_PROGRESS_BY_AGENT</span> <span class="text-zinc-400 ml-auto">same AGENT</span></div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-indigo-50 border border-indigo-200">IN_PROGRESS_BY_AGENT</span> <span class="text-zinc-400">→</span> <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200">AWAITING_HUMAN_APPROVAL</span> <span class="text-zinc-400 ml-auto">agent done</span></div>
								<div class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200">AWAITING_HUMAN_APPROVAL</span> <span class="text-zinc-400">→</span> <span class="px-2 py-1 rounded bg-sky-50 border border-sky-200">AWAITING_AGENT_PICKUP</span> <span class="text-zinc-400 ml-auto">human ✅</span></div>
